[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5102.149, "timestamp": "01:25:02", "text": "話している。うん。オリンは、まるで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5104.31, "timestamp": "01:25:04", "text": "実際に横歩きするような感じ。それは それは"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5104.886, "timestamp": "01:25:04", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "true"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5105.99, "timestamp": "01:25:05", "text": "本当に良い。まるで本当に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5107.669, "timestamp": "01:25:07", "text": "良い。だから、歩く場所があるのに、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5114.229, "timestamp": "01:25:14", "text": "そう、傘が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5117.51, "timestamp": "01:25:17", "text": "盗まれた。だから、常に安い傘を買っておきましょう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5120.39, "timestamp": "01:25:20", "text": "安い傘。そして、問題は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5122.31, "timestamp": "01:25:22", "text": "彼らには、もしあなたが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5124.07, "timestamp": "01:25:24", "text": "どこかに傘があって、それからあなたは"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5125.802, "timestamp": "01:25:25", "author": "@saikatdey0909", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mT2Up10wsYYwilcayEwYxOCwTgzDSnNztFejTB-x02nR8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6QoUCdZBnUb7m8Pd_wUTDNqUu3Q/f3TlZ_yAK5S3_9EP-duW6Qo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5126.149, "timestamp": "01:25:26", "text": "傘を放置すると、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5127.91, "timestamp": "01:25:27", "text": "透明。手に取って"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5128.029, "timestamp": "01:25:28", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "don't worry the umbrella will only get stolen when you leave it the umbrella container"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5130.47, "timestamp": "01:25:30", "text": "使用後は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5132.07, "timestamp": "01:25:32", "text": "駅の物みたいに、ただ吊るすだけ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5133.75, "timestamp": "01:25:33", "text": "次の人が"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5134.973, "timestamp": "01:25:34", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "like outside stores"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5137.43, "timestamp": "01:25:37", "text": "あなたが使った後に使ってください。それは実際にはそうではない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5140.79, "timestamp": "01:25:40", "text": "違法です。わかった。しかし、人はそういうことをするものだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5142.149, "timestamp": "01:25:42", "text": "それはよくあることです。彼らが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5143.91, "timestamp": "01:25:43", "text": "それでもやっている。しかし、私たちはかつて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5145.99, "timestamp": "01:25:45", "text": "それ。以前、傘を忘れたことがありました。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5147.75, "timestamp": "01:25:47", "text": "まるで傘が置いてあるかのように、傘を取った。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5149.669, "timestamp": "01:25:49", "text": "どこか下の方。私はそれを受け取った。私は来た"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5156.27, "timestamp": "01:25:56", "text": "駅。あなたが去るとき"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5158.55, "timestamp": "01:25:58", "text": "心配しないで。傘は"}]